(S) Stores must be equipped with handwashing facilities that include:
 (a) Handwashing sinks with hot and cold running water, hand soap and disposable paper towels or air dryers;
 (b) Hands-free (non-manual) faucets or touchless controls where possible;
 (c) Pedal-operated trash receptacles for disposal of paper towels
 (d) Dumping or rinsing is not taking place in dedicated hand sink

